  <Strings>
    <Section>s1-2</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2062</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00009a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やったぞ……リブガロの角だ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Conseguimos... Temos o chifre
do Livgaro!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2084</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00009b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>これで&lt;Annie&gt;は助かるぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Agora podemos salvar &lt;Annie&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00009c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フランツさん、
早く、薬を作って!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Frantz, anda logo e faz
o remédio!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2174</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00009d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ここではできない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não posso fazer isso aqui...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2262</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00009e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうして!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Por que não?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a00009f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>角の中身を薬に使うのだが、
光に当てると成分が変化してしまう。
真っ暗な場所が必要だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O conteúdo do chifre serve pra
fazer o remédio, mas a luz muda os
componentes químicos. Tem que ser
feito na total escuridão.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2305</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a0000a0</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>真っ暗な場所か……
アニカマルで部屋を
借りるしかない。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Escuridão total... Vamos ter que
conseguir um quarto em Anikamal.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2326</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a0000a1</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、大丈夫かな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mas será que vai dar certo?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2347</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a0000a2</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アニカマルへ戻ろう。
どんな事をしてでも
&lt;Annie&gt;を救う。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vamos voltar a Anikamal.
Vamos salvar &lt;Annie&gt; custe
o que custar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2368</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a0000a3</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よし、急ごう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Certo, vamos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1636</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000098</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>チクショウ……
目の前で逃がすなんて……
早くしないと&lt;Annie&gt;が！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Droga! Escapou bem na nossa
frente! Temos que correr, senão
&lt;Annie&gt; vai...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1657</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1a000099</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……追うぞ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Atrás dele!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
